# L3 probe 5 (2026-10-24): the driver's l3-* handlers (APS5_PORTER_L3=1, Execution/src/Driver/EngineMarks.cpp)
# write a NOP marker into the engine context's command buffer before each engine draw and material bind, and the
# draw handlers route the function's return through a stub that writes an end marker. The driver attributes the
# draw packets between begin and end to the engine, lists the programs and guest call sites of the other
# ("foreign") draws and prints "[l3]", "[l3-foreign]", "[l3-sites]" and "[l3-other]" lines every 10 s.
# Load with APS5_GUEST_HOOKS=<this file> and APS5_PORTER_L3=1.
